<section class="lumen-section">
  <div class="lumen-container">
    <div style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);margin-bottom:0.85rem;padding-bottom:0.55rem;border-bottom:3px solid var(--lu-yellow);display:inline-block">03 / Components</div>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem+1.5vw,3.25rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);line-height:1.0;margin:0.5rem 0 2rem">Building blocks.</h2>

    <div style="padding:1.75rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--lu-line)">
      <div style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:1.18rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);margin-bottom:1rem">Buttons</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.85rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.75rem">
        <a href="#" class="lumen-btn">Book a Job</a>
        <a href="#" class="lumen-btn lumen-btn-outline">Call (928) 315-9094</a>
      </div>
      <p style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--lu-gray);max-width:62ch;margin:0">Black fill + yellow text by default. Outline is black-on-bone with a 3px black inset border. No rounded corners, no transitions beyond color flips.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:1.75rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--lu-line)">
      <div style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:1.18rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);margin-bottom:1rem">Highlight</div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">
        <span style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:1.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Real fast. <em style="background:var(--lu-yellow);padding:0 0.1em;color:var(--lu-black)">Done right.</em></span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--lu-gray);max-width:62ch;margin:0">Yellow background on em element. Always black text on yellow. Used for emphasis at the headline level only; never inside body copy.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:1.75rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--lu-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--lu-line)">
      <div style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:1.18rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);margin-bottom:1rem">Stat block</div>
      <div style="background:var(--lu-black);color:var(--lu-yellow);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto;gap:1rem 2rem;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0.75rem">
        <span style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:2.25rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em">2,300+</span>
        <span style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF">jobs closed since 2014, all permit-pulled</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--lu-gray);max-width:62ch;margin:0">Black surface, yellow number, white label. Reserved for hard, verifiable counts. Never decorative metrics.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="lumen-section">
  <div class="lumen-container">
    <div style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);margin-bottom:0.85rem;padding-bottom:0.55rem;border-bottom:3px solid var(--lu-yellow);display:inline-block">04 / Voice</div>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem+1.5vw,3.25rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lu-black);line-height:1.0;margin:0.5rem 0 0.75rem">Sound like a master <em style="background:var(--lu-yellow);padding:0 0.1em;color:var(--lu-black)">electrician.</em></h2>
    <p style="max-width:62ch;color:var(--lu-gray);margin:0 0 1.75rem;font-size:1.05rem">If a sentence wouldn't be said by Ray on a job site at 4pm on a Tuesday, it doesn't go on the website.</p>

    <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;max-width:64ch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.85rem;font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif">
      <li style="padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--lu-black);color:#FFFFFF"><strong style="color:var(--lu-yellow)">Short. Declarative. Period.</strong> No semicolons, no asides. The trade is binary. The voice is binary.</li>
      <li style="padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--lu-black);color:#FFFFFF"><strong style="color:var(--lu-yellow)">Permit-pulled, code-passed.</strong> Specifics that prove the work. Job counts, license numbers, inspection results.</li>
      <li style="padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--lu-black);color:#FFFFFF"><strong style="color:var(--lu-yellow)">No "premium," no "professional."</strong> Adjectives that say nothing. The work says it.</li>
      <li style="padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--lu-black);color:#FFFFFF"><strong style="color:var(--lu-yellow)">All caps for emphasis only.</strong> Headlines, button labels, stat numbers. Never inside body copy.</li>
      <li style="padding:1rem 1.25rem;background:var(--lu-black);color:#FFFFFF"><strong style="color:var(--lu-yellow)">No exclamation marks ever.</strong> Confidence doesn't shout.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

